      "clozeText": "Technological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in solar-powered villa will rely on automatic solar panels to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating rooftop garden proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.",
      "readingText": "Eco-Friendly Smart Homes Powered by Solar Roofs represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within solar-powered villa, this initiative demonstrates how automatic solar panels and voice-command appliances can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt monitoring daily energy use report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded rooftop garden to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
