      "audioScript": "Mark: Hi Hoa! What futuristic technology or green project are you presenting today?\nHoa: Hi Mark! I am presenting about Household Helper Robots Washing Dishes and Mopping and its application in modern kitchen.\nMark: How will it help our society or environment?\nHoa: It utilizes smart robotic arms and enables humans to practice cleaning kitchen counters.\nMark: Does it also improve vacuuming living room rugs?\nHoa: Yes, and it significantly enhances sustainability by incorporating voice recognition sensor.\nMark: Fantastic! That will help our planet become much greener and smarter.",
      "clozeText": "Technological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in modern kitchen will rely on smart robotic arms to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating voice recognition sensor proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.",
      "readingText": "Household Helper Robots Washing Dishes and Mopping represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within modern kitchen, this initiative demonstrates how smart robotic arms and vacuuming living room rugs can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt cleaning kitchen counters report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded voice recognition sensor to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTechnological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in modern kitchen will rely on smart robotic arms to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating voice recognition sensor proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nHousehold Helper Robots Washing Dishes and Mopping represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within modern kitchen, this initiative demonstrates how smart robotic arms and vacuuming living room rugs can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt cleaning kitchen counters report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded voice recognition sensor to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
