          "correct": "Replacing Single-Use Plastics with Reusable Totes offers an exciting vision for future generations. Situated in school canteen, it harnesses cloth shopping bags to make our living environment cleaner. Practicing carrying bamboo utensils teaches teenagers to become responsible global citizens. In addition, integrating compostable food boxes ensures that sustainability remains at the heart of modern development. I hope more communities will embrace this eco-friendly lifestyle.",
