      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What futuristic technology or green project are you presenting today?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Doctor Robots Assisting in Hospital Surgeries and its application in smart hospital.\nAlex: How will it help our society or environment?\nMinh: It utilizes precision laser arms and enables humans to practice sanitizing operating rooms.\nAlex: Does it also improve measuring patient heartbeat?\nMinh: Yes, and it significantly enhances sustainability by incorporating medical AI database.\nAlex: Fantastic! That will help our planet become much greener and smarter.",
      "clozeText": "Technological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in smart hospital will rely on precision laser arms to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating medical AI database proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.",
      "readingText": "Doctor Robots Assisting in Hospital Surgeries represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within smart hospital, this initiative demonstrates how precision laser arms and measuring patient heartbeat can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt sanitizing operating rooms report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded medical AI database to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTechnological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in smart hospital will rely on precision laser arms to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating medical AI database proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nDoctor Robots Assisting in Hospital Surgeries represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within smart hospital, this initiative demonstrates how precision laser arms and measuring patient heartbeat can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt sanitizing operating rooms report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded medical AI database to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
