      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What futuristic technology or green project are you presenting today?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Floating Amphibious Houses Designed for Rising Sea Levels and its application in floating village.\nAlex: How will it help our society or environment?\nMinh: It utilizes waterproof foundation floats and enables humans to practice fishing from the deck.\nAlex: Does it also improve adapting to tides?\nMinh: Yes, and it significantly enhances sustainability by incorporating solar water purifier.\nAlex: Fantastic! That will help our planet become much greener and smarter.",
      "clozeText": "Technological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in floating village will rely on waterproof foundation floats to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating solar water purifier proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.",
      "readingText": "Floating Amphibious Houses Designed for Rising Sea Levels represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within floating village, this initiative demonstrates how waterproof foundation floats and adapting to tides can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt fishing from the deck report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded solar water purifier to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTechnological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in floating village will rely on waterproof foundation floats to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating solar water purifier proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nFloating Amphibious Houses Designed for Rising Sea Levels represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within floating village, this initiative demonstrates how waterproof foundation floats and adapting to tides can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt fishing from the deck report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded solar water purifier to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
