          "correct": "Floating Amphibious Houses Designed for Rising Sea Levels offers an exciting vision for future generations. Situated in floating village, it harnesses waterproof foundation floats to make our living environment cleaner. Practicing fishing from the deck teaches teenagers to become responsible global citizens. In addition, integrating solar water purifier ensures that sustainability remains at the heart of modern development. I hope more communities will embrace this eco-friendly lifestyle.",
