      "audioScript": "Mark: Hi Hoa! What futuristic technology or green project are you presenting today?\nHoa: Hi Mark! I am presenting about Setting up Paper and Plastic Sorting Stations and its application in school playground.\nMark: How will it help our society or environment?\nHoa: It utilizes reusable collection boxes and enables humans to practice raising environmental awareness.\nMark: Does it also improve exchanging scrap carton for plants?\nHoa: Yes, and it significantly enhances sustainability by incorporating volunteer youth team.\nMark: Fantastic! That will help our planet become much greener and smarter.",
      "clozeText": "Technological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in school playground will rely on reusable collection boxes to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating volunteer youth team proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.",
      "readingText": "Setting up Paper and Plastic Sorting Stations represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within school playground, this initiative demonstrates how reusable collection boxes and exchanging scrap carton for plants can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt raising environmental awareness report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded volunteer youth team to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTechnological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in school playground will rely on reusable collection boxes to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating volunteer youth team proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSetting up Paper and Plastic Sorting Stations represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within school playground, this initiative demonstrates how reusable collection boxes and exchanging scrap carton for plants can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt raising environmental awareness report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded volunteer youth team to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
