          "correct": "Setting up Paper and Plastic Sorting Stations offers an exciting vision for future generations. Situated in school playground, it harnesses reusable collection boxes to make our living environment cleaner. Practicing raising environmental awareness teaches teenagers to become responsible global citizens. In addition, integrating volunteer youth team ensures that sustainability remains at the heart of modern development. I hope more communities will embrace this eco-friendly lifestyle.",
