          "correct": "Zero-Energy Underground Homes with Geothermal Cooling offers an exciting vision for future generations. Situated in underground eco-dwelling, it harnesses geothermal ventilation tubes to make our living environment cleaner. Practicing keeping constant temperature teaches teenagers to become responsible global citizens. In addition, integrating recycled brick walls ensures that sustainability remains at the heart of modern development. I hope more communities will embrace this eco-friendly lifestyle.",
