      "audioScript": "Mark: Hi Hoa! What futuristic technology or green project are you presenting today?\nHoa: Hi Mark! I am presenting about Conserving Tap Water While Brushing and Washing and its application in school washroom.\nMark: How will it help our society or environment?\nHoa: It utilizes sensor-activated water taps and enables humans to practice collecting rainwater for trees.\nMark: Does it also improve turning off running faucets?\nHoa: Yes, and it significantly enhances sustainability by incorporating water conservation poster.\nMark: Fantastic! That will help our planet become much greener and smarter.",
      "clozeText": "Technological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in school washroom will rely on sensor-activated water taps to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating water conservation poster proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.",
      "readingText": "Conserving Tap Water While Brushing and Washing represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within school washroom, this initiative demonstrates how sensor-activated water taps and turning off running faucets can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt collecting rainwater for trees report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded water conservation poster to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTechnological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in school washroom will rely on sensor-activated water taps to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating water conservation poster proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nConserving Tap Water While Brushing and Washing represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within school washroom, this initiative demonstrates how sensor-activated water taps and turning off running faucets can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt collecting rainwater for trees report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded water conservation poster to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
