          "correct": "Conserving Tap Water While Brushing and Washing offers an exciting vision for future generations. Situated in school washroom, it harnesses sensor-activated water taps to make our living environment cleaner. Practicing collecting rainwater for trees teaches teenagers to become responsible global citizens. In addition, integrating water conservation poster ensures that sustainability remains at the heart of modern development. I hope more communities will embrace this eco-friendly lifestyle.",
