          "correct": "Robotic Exploration Rovers on the Surface of Mars offers an exciting vision for future generations. Situated in Mars exploration station, it harnesses robotic sample drill to make our living environment cleaner. Practicing broadcasting high-resolution photos teaches teenagers to become responsible global citizens. In addition, integrating radioisotope battery ensures that sustainability remains at the heart of modern development. I hope more communities will embrace this eco-friendly lifestyle.",
