      "audioScript": "Mark: Hi Hoa! What futuristic technology or green project are you presenting today?\nHoa: Hi Mark! I am presenting about Smart Windows Generating Electricity from Sunlight and its application in high-rise building.\nMark: How will it help our society or environment?\nHoa: It utilizes transparent photovoltaic glass and enables humans to practice cooling office rooms.\nMark: Does it also improve generating clean electricity?\nHoa: Yes, and it significantly enhances sustainability by incorporating energy storage battery.\nMark: Fantastic! That will help our planet become much greener and smarter.",
      "clozeText": "Technological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in high-rise building will rely on transparent photovoltaic glass to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating energy storage battery proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.",
      "readingText": "Smart Windows Generating Electricity from Sunlight represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within high-rise building, this initiative demonstrates how transparent photovoltaic glass and generating clean electricity can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt cooling office rooms report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded energy storage battery to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTechnological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in high-rise building will rely on transparent photovoltaic glass to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating energy storage battery proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSmart Windows Generating Electricity from Sunlight represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within high-rise building, this initiative demonstrates how transparent photovoltaic glass and generating clean electricity can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt cooling office rooms report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded energy storage battery to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
