          "correct": "Smart Windows Generating Electricity from Sunlight offers an exciting vision for future generations. Situated in high-rise building, it harnesses transparent photovoltaic glass to make our living environment cleaner. Practicing cooling office rooms teaches teenagers to become responsible global citizens. In addition, integrating energy storage battery ensures that sustainability remains at the heart of modern development. I hope more communities will embrace this eco-friendly lifestyle.",
