      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What futuristic technology or green project are you presenting today?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about The Future Friendship between Humans and Androids and its application in robotics exhibition.\nAlex: How will it help our society or environment?\nMinh: It utilizes empathetic facial expressions and enables humans to practice assisting elderly people.\nAlex: Does it also improve playing chess with students?\nMinh: Yes, and it significantly enhances sustainability by incorporating ethical robot code.\nAlex: Fantastic! That will help our planet become much greener and smarter.",
      "clozeText": "Technological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in robotics exhibition will rely on empathetic facial expressions to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating ethical robot code proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.",
      "readingText": "The Future Friendship between Humans and Androids represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within robotics exhibition, this initiative demonstrates how empathetic facial expressions and playing chess with students can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt assisting elderly people report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded ethical robot code to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTechnological innovation and green living are shaping our future. In the coming decades, people in robotics exhibition will rely on empathetic facial expressions to power their daily routines. If we actively practice (23) ________ and energy conservation, our cities will become cleaner. Many experts predict that helper robots (24) ________ take over dangerous household and industrial tasks. However, citizens (25) ________ depend entirely on machines for basic personal responsibilities. Furthermore, integrating ethical robot code proves that human ingenuity can protect the natural (26) ________. In conclusion, living in harmony with smart technology will foster a (27) ________ society.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe Future Friendship between Humans and Androids represents an inspiring milestone in the transition toward a cleaner and more technologically advanced world. Situated within robotics exhibition, this initiative demonstrates how empathetic facial expressions and playing chess with students can reduce carbon footprints effectively. Families and students who adopt assisting elderly people report remarkable decreases in electricity costs and municipal waste generation. In addition, engineers have embedded ethical robot code to maximize renewable efficiency and ensure long-term reliability. Environmentalists emphasize that individual actions, such as sorting rubbish and turning off idle gadgets, complement high-tech automation. By combining responsible environmental ethics with intelligent robotic systems, humankind can build a prosperous, sustainable future.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
