          "correct": "The Future Friendship between Humans and Androids offers an exciting vision for future generations. Situated in robotics exhibition, it harnesses empathetic facial expressions to make our living environment cleaner. Practicing assisting elderly people teaches teenagers to become responsible global citizens. In addition, integrating ethical robot code ensures that sustainability remains at the heart of modern development. I hope more communities will embrace this eco-friendly lifestyle.",
