      "audioScript": "Mark: Hi Hoa! What topic are you investigating for the unit on energy, future transport, and English-speaking countries?\nHoa: Hi Mark! I am presenting about Solar Energy Farms in South-Central Viet Nam related to Ninh Thuan solar plant.\nMark: What is the most exciting aspect of this development?\nHoa: Engineers and travelers are thrilled by gleaming solar panels and love generating solar energy.\nMark: How will it help our global environment and communication?\nHoa: It harnesses abundant clean electricity and demonstrates the breakthrough efficiency of storage battery bank.\nMark: Wonderful! That will inspire our classmates to think about clean technologies.",
      "clozeText": "Transitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In Ninh Thuan solar plant, engineers are utilizing gleaming solar panels to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing storage battery bank guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.",
      "readingText": "Solar Energy Farms in South-Central Viet Nam represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in Ninh Thuan solar plant. By utilizing gleaming solar panels and abundant clean electricity, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test generating solar energy report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize storage battery bank as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTransitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In Ninh Thuan solar plant, engineers are utilizing gleaming solar panels to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing storage battery bank guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSolar Energy Farms in South-Central Viet Nam represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in Ninh Thuan solar plant. By utilizing gleaming solar panels and abundant clean electricity, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test generating solar energy report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize storage battery bank as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
