      "clozeText": "Transitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In smart city vertiport, engineers are utilizing multirotor electric engines to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing rooftop landing pad guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.",
      "readingText": "Autonomous Solar-Powered Flying Taxis represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in smart city vertiport. By utilizing multirotor electric engines and autopilot GPS navigation, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test flying above traffic gridlock report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize rooftop landing pad as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
