      "clozeText": "Transitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In Rotorua and Auckland, engineers are utilizing steaming volcanic geysers to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing kiwi bird reserve guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.",
      "readingText": "New Zealand - Maori Culture and Geothermal Geysers represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in Rotorua and Auckland. By utilizing steaming volcanic geysers and historic Maori Haka dance, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test exploring scenic fjords report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize kiwi bird reserve as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTransitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In Rotorua and Auckland, engineers are utilizing steaming volcanic geysers to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing kiwi bird reserve guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nNew Zealand - Maori Culture and Geothermal Geysers represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in Rotorua and Auckland. By utilizing steaming volcanic geysers and historic Maori Haka dance, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test exploring scenic fjords report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize kiwi bird reserve as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
