      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What topic are you investigating for the unit on energy, future transport, and English-speaking countries?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about The United States - Grand Canyon and Tech Giants related to California and Arizona.\nAlex: What is the most exciting aspect of this development?\nMinh: Engineers and travelers are thrilled by vast red rock canyons and love visiting NASA space museum.\nAlex: How will it help our global environment and communication?\nMinh: It harnesses Silicon Valley innovations and demonstrates the breakthrough efficiency of Golden Gate Bridge.\nAlex: Wonderful! That will inspire our classmates to think about clean technologies.",
      "clozeText": "Transitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In California and Arizona, engineers are utilizing vast red rock canyons to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing Golden Gate Bridge guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.",
      "readingText": "The United States - Grand Canyon and Tech Giants represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in California and Arizona. By utilizing vast red rock canyons and Silicon Valley innovations, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test visiting NASA space museum report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize Golden Gate Bridge as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTransitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In California and Arizona, engineers are utilizing vast red rock canyons to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing Golden Gate Bridge guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe United States - Grand Canyon and Tech Giants represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in California and Arizona. By utilizing vast red rock canyons and Silicon Valley innovations, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test visiting NASA space museum report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize Golden Gate Bridge as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
