      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What topic are you investigating for the unit on energy, future transport, and English-speaking countries?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Solar-Powered High-Speed Catamarans and Ferries related to coastal archipelago.\nAlex: What is the most exciting aspect of this development?\nMinh: Engineers and travelers are thrilled by lightweight solar hulls and love island hopping on ferries.\nAlex: How will it help our global environment and communication?\nMinh: It harnesses whisper-quiet sea travel and demonstrates the breakthrough efficiency of solar canopy roof.\nAlex: Wonderful! That will inspire our classmates to think about clean technologies.",
      "clozeText": "Transitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In coastal archipelago, engineers are utilizing lightweight solar hulls to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing solar canopy roof guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.",
      "readingText": "Solar-Powered High-Speed Catamarans and Ferries represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in coastal archipelago. By utilizing lightweight solar hulls and whisper-quiet sea travel, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test island hopping on ferries report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize solar canopy roof as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
