      "audioScript": "Mark: Hi Hoa! What topic are you investigating for the unit on energy, future transport, and English-speaking countries?\nHoa: Hi Mark! I am presenting about The United Kingdom - Historic Castles and London Fog related to Edinburgh and London.\nMark: What is the most exciting aspect of this development?\nHoa: Engineers and travelers are thrilled by ancient stone fortresses and love touring Tower of London.\nMark: How will it help our global environment and communication?\nHoa: It harnesses traditional afternoon tea and demonstrates the breakthrough efficiency of Big Ben clock tower.\nMark: Wonderful! That will inspire our classmates to think about clean technologies.",
      "clozeText": "Transitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In Edinburgh and London, engineers are utilizing ancient stone fortresses to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing Big Ben clock tower guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.",
      "readingText": "The United Kingdom - Historic Castles and London Fog represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in Edinburgh and London. By utilizing ancient stone fortresses and traditional afternoon tea, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test touring Tower of London report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize Big Ben clock tower as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTransitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In Edinburgh and London, engineers are utilizing ancient stone fortresses to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing Big Ben clock tower guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe United Kingdom - Historic Castles and London Fog represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in Edinburgh and London. By utilizing ancient stone fortresses and traditional afternoon tea, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test touring Tower of London report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize Big Ben clock tower as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
