      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What topic are you investigating for the unit on energy, future transport, and English-speaking countries?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Geothermal Power Plants Tapping Underground Heat related to volcanic valley station.\nAlex: What is the most exciting aspect of this development?\nMinh: Engineers and travelers are thrilled by deep geothermal steam wells and love monitoring steam pressure.\nAlex: How will it help our global environment and communication?\nMinh: It harnesses continuous clean baseload power and demonstrates the breakthrough efficiency of thermal turbine hall.\nAlex: Wonderful! That will inspire our classmates to think about clean technologies.",
      "clozeText": "Transitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In volcanic valley station, engineers are utilizing deep geothermal steam wells to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing thermal turbine hall guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.",
      "readingText": "Geothermal Power Plants Tapping Underground Heat represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in volcanic valley station. By utilizing deep geothermal steam wells and continuous clean baseload power, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test monitoring steam pressure report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize thermal turbine hall as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
