      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What topic are you investigating for the unit on energy, future transport, and English-speaking countries?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Ireland - Emerald Countryside and Celtic Legends related to Dublin and Galway.\nAlex: What is the most exciting aspect of this development?\nMinh: Engineers and travelers are thrilled by rolling emerald green hills and love playing traditional harp.\nAlex: How will it help our global environment and communication?\nMinh: It harnesses ancient Celtic stone castles and demonstrates the breakthrough efficiency of St. Patrick festival parade.\nAlex: Wonderful! That will inspire our classmates to think about clean technologies.",
      "clozeText": "Transitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In Dublin and Galway, engineers are utilizing rolling emerald green hills to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing St. Patrick festival parade guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.",
      "readingText": "Ireland - Emerald Countryside and Celtic Legends represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in Dublin and Galway. By utilizing rolling emerald green hills and ancient Celtic stone castles, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test playing traditional harp report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize St. Patrick festival parade as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nTransitioning to renewable energy sources and sustainable transportation is essential for our planet. In Dublin and Galway, engineers are utilizing rolling emerald green hills to reduce dependence on fossil (23) ________. If humanity continues to expand wind and solar power, carbon emissions will decrease (24) ________. Furthermore, innovative transport modes will allow commuters to travel (25) ________ than ever before. Connecting with English-speaking countries also helps learners exchange advanced (26) ________ with international scientists. In conclusion, embracing St. Patrick festival parade guarantees a greener and more prosperous (27) ________ for all nations.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nIreland - Emerald Countryside and Celtic Legends represents an outstanding breakthrough in clean technology and international cultural connection in Dublin and Galway. By utilizing rolling emerald green hills and ancient Celtic stone castles, this initiative provides reliable, carbon-neutral solutions for communities and travelers. Commuters and scientists who test playing traditional harp report substantial improvements in energy efficiency, speed, and environmental safety. Technical experts emphasize St. Patrick festival parade as a transformative element that accelerates the global shift away from polluting fossil fuels. Moreover, fostering partnerships with English-speaking nations provides access to cutting-edge research and educational exchanges. Investing in renewable power and futuristic transportation paves the path toward a healthier, united world.",
