      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_8_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What futuristic communication or scientific breakthrough are you presenting?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about 3D Hologram Video Communication in Virtual Classrooms at virtual reality academy.\nAlex: What is the most astonishing feature of this innovation?\nMinh: Researchers and users are captivated by lifelike 3D holographic teachers and eager to test interacting with holographic models.\nAlex: How will it revolutionize human life or space exploration?\nMinh: It advances spatial audio conferencing and relies on the groundbreaking precision of photonic projector headset.\nAlex: Incredible! That sounds like science fiction turning into scientific reality.",
      "clozeText": "Rapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In virtual reality academy, scientists are developing lifelike 3D holographic teachers to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice interacting with holographic models with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering spatial audio conferencing expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering photonic projector headset will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "3D Hologram Video Communication in Virtual Classrooms stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in virtual reality academy. By combining lifelike 3D holographic teachers with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in spatial audio conferencing. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving interacting with holographic models have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight photonic projector headset as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nRapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In virtual reality academy, scientists are developing lifelike 3D holographic teachers to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice interacting with holographic models with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering spatial audio conferencing expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering photonic projector headset will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\n3D Hologram Video Communication in Virtual Classrooms stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in virtual reality academy. By combining lifelike 3D holographic teachers with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in spatial audio conferencing. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving interacting with holographic models have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight photonic projector headset as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, 3D Hologram Video Communication in Virtual Classrooms represents an astonishing leap for science and humanity. Located in virtual reality academy, it harnesses lifelike 3D holographic teachers to solve challenges that once seemed insurmountable. Enabling people to practice interacting with holographic models expands our cognitive and technological horizons. Furthermore, the relentless precision of photonic projector headset paves the way for interstellar exploration. I am confident this innovation will shape a brighter tomorrow.",
