      "audioScript": "Ben: Hi Trang! What futuristic communication or scientific breakthrough are you presenting?\nTrang: Hi Ben! I am presenting about Artificial Intelligence in Early Medical Diagnostics at smart oncology lab.\nBen: What is the most astonishing feature of this innovation?\nTrang: Researchers and users are captivated by deep learning neural algorithms and eager to test detecting early disease symptoms.\nBen: How will it revolutionize human life or space exploration?\nTrang: It advances microscopic cellular imaging and relies on the groundbreaking precision of biomedical AI database.\nBen: Incredible! That sounds like science fiction turning into scientific reality.",
      "clozeText": "Rapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In smart oncology lab, scientists are developing deep learning neural algorithms to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice detecting early disease symptoms with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering microscopic cellular imaging expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering biomedical AI database will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Artificial Intelligence in Early Medical Diagnostics stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in smart oncology lab. By combining deep learning neural algorithms with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in microscopic cellular imaging. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving detecting early disease symptoms have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight biomedical AI database as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nRapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In smart oncology lab, scientists are developing deep learning neural algorithms to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice detecting early disease symptoms with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering microscopic cellular imaging expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering biomedical AI database will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nArtificial Intelligence in Early Medical Diagnostics stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in smart oncology lab. By combining deep learning neural algorithms with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in microscopic cellular imaging. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving detecting early disease symptoms have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight biomedical AI database as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
