      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What futuristic communication or scientific breakthrough are you presenting?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Exploring Subsurface Oceans on Jupiter's Moon Europa at deep space probe control.\nAlex: What is the most astonishing feature of this innovation?\nMinh: Researchers and users are captivated by thick icy crust drillers and eager to test analyzing extraterrestrial water.\nAlex: How will it revolutionize human life or space exploration?\nMinh: It advances hydrothermal ocean vents and relies on the groundbreaking precision of autonomous robotic submarine.\nAlex: Incredible! That sounds like science fiction turning into scientific reality.",
      "clozeText": "Rapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In deep space probe control, scientists are developing thick icy crust drillers to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice analyzing extraterrestrial water with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering hydrothermal ocean vents expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering autonomous robotic submarine will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Exploring Subsurface Oceans on Jupiter's Moon Europa stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in deep space probe control. By combining thick icy crust drillers with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in hydrothermal ocean vents. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving analyzing extraterrestrial water have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight autonomous robotic submarine as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nRapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In deep space probe control, scientists are developing thick icy crust drillers to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice analyzing extraterrestrial water with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering hydrothermal ocean vents expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering autonomous robotic submarine will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nExploring Subsurface Oceans on Jupiter's Moon Europa stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in deep space probe control. By combining thick icy crust drillers with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in hydrothermal ocean vents. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving analyzing extraterrestrial water have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight autonomous robotic submarine as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
