      "audioScript": "Ben: Hi Trang! What futuristic communication or scientific breakthrough are you presenting?\nTrang: Hi Ben! I am presenting about Telepathic Neural Headsets and Direct Thought Transmissions at neuroscience laboratory.\nBen: What is the most astonishing feature of this innovation?\nTrang: Researchers and users are captivated by non-invasive brainwave sensors and eager to test communicating without speaking.\nBen: How will it revolutionize human life or space exploration?\nTrang: It advances instant thought-to-text decoding and relies on the groundbreaking precision of neural interface headset.\nBen: Incredible! That sounds like science fiction turning into scientific reality.",
      "clozeText": "Rapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In neuroscience laboratory, scientists are developing non-invasive brainwave sensors to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice communicating without speaking with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering instant thought-to-text decoding expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering neural interface headset will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Telepathic Neural Headsets and Direct Thought Transmissions stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in neuroscience laboratory. By combining non-invasive brainwave sensors with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in instant thought-to-text decoding. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving communicating without speaking have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight neural interface headset as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nRapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In neuroscience laboratory, scientists are developing non-invasive brainwave sensors to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice communicating without speaking with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering instant thought-to-text decoding expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering neural interface headset will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nTelepathic Neural Headsets and Direct Thought Transmissions stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in neuroscience laboratory. By combining non-invasive brainwave sensors with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in instant thought-to-text decoding. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving communicating without speaking have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight neural interface headset as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
