      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What futuristic communication or scientific breakthrough are you presenting?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Nanotechnology and Targeted Drug Delivery in Healthcare at nanomedicine clinic.\nAlex: What is the most astonishing feature of this innovation?\nMinh: Researchers and users are captivated by microscopic nanobots and eager to test injecting smart nanocapsules.\nAlex: How will it revolutionize human life or space exploration?\nMinh: It advances destroying malignant cells and relies on the groundbreaking precision of precision cellular scanner.\nAlex: Incredible! That sounds like science fiction turning into scientific reality.",
      "clozeText": "Rapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In nanomedicine clinic, scientists are developing microscopic nanobots to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice injecting smart nanocapsules with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering destroying malignant cells expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering precision cellular scanner will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Nanotechnology and Targeted Drug Delivery in Healthcare stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in nanomedicine clinic. By combining microscopic nanobots with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in destroying malignant cells. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving injecting smart nanocapsules have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight precision cellular scanner as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nRapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In nanomedicine clinic, scientists are developing microscopic nanobots to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice injecting smart nanocapsules with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering destroying malignant cells expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering precision cellular scanner will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nNanotechnology and Targeted Drug Delivery in Healthcare stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in nanomedicine clinic. By combining microscopic nanobots with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in destroying malignant cells. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving injecting smart nanocapsules have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight precision cellular scanner as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
