      "audioScript": "Ben: Hi Trang! What futuristic communication or scientific breakthrough are you presenting?\nTrang: Hi Ben! I am presenting about Bionic Prosthetics Powered by Neural Muscle Signals at rehabilitation hospital.\nBen: What is the most astonishing feature of this innovation?\nTrang: Researchers and users are captivated by carbon-fiber robotic limbs and eager to test regaining independent mobility.\nBen: How will it revolutionize human life or space exploration?\nTrang: It advances intuitive muscle nerve sensors and relies on the groundbreaking precision of bionic grip controller.\nBen: Incredible! That sounds like science fiction turning into scientific reality.",
      "clozeText": "Rapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In rehabilitation hospital, scientists are developing carbon-fiber robotic limbs to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice regaining independent mobility with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering intuitive muscle nerve sensors expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering bionic grip controller will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Bionic Prosthetics Powered by Neural Muscle Signals stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in rehabilitation hospital. By combining carbon-fiber robotic limbs with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in intuitive muscle nerve sensors. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving regaining independent mobility have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight bionic grip controller as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nRapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In rehabilitation hospital, scientists are developing carbon-fiber robotic limbs to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice regaining independent mobility with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering intuitive muscle nerve sensors expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering bionic grip controller will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nBionic Prosthetics Powered by Neural Muscle Signals stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in rehabilitation hospital. By combining carbon-fiber robotic limbs with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in intuitive muscle nerve sensors. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving regaining independent mobility have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight bionic grip controller as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
