      "audioScript": "Ben: Hi Trang! What futuristic communication or scientific breakthrough are you presenting?\nTrang: Hi Ben! I am presenting about Haptic Touch Suits for Immersive Virtual Reality Training at flight simulation center.\nBen: What is the most astonishing feature of this innovation?\nTrang: Researchers and users are captivated by vibrotactile force-feedback sensors and eager to test training emergency pilots.\nBen: How will it revolutionize human life or space exploration?\nTrang: It advances feeling realistic physical resistance and relies on the groundbreaking precision of haptic feedback vest.\nBen: Incredible! That sounds like science fiction turning into scientific reality.",
      "clozeText": "Rapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In flight simulation center, scientists are developing vibrotactile force-feedback sensors to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice training emergency pilots with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering feeling realistic physical resistance expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering haptic feedback vest will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Haptic Touch Suits for Immersive Virtual Reality Training stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in flight simulation center. By combining vibrotactile force-feedback sensors with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in feeling realistic physical resistance. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving training emergency pilots have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight haptic feedback vest as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nRapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In flight simulation center, scientists are developing vibrotactile force-feedback sensors to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice training emergency pilots with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering feeling realistic physical resistance expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering haptic feedback vest will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nHaptic Touch Suits for Immersive Virtual Reality Training stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in flight simulation center. By combining vibrotactile force-feedback sensors with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in feeling realistic physical resistance. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving training emergency pilots have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight haptic feedback vest as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
