      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What futuristic communication or scientific breakthrough are you presenting?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Gesture-Controlled Holographic Interfaces for Surgeons at futuristic operating theater.\nAlex: What is the most astonishing feature of this innovation?\nMinh: Researchers and users are captivated by motion-tracking infrared cameras and eager to test performing sterile surgeries.\nAlex: How will it revolutionize human life or space exploration?\nMinh: It advances manipulating floating patient scans and relies on the groundbreaking precision of contactless gesture sensor.\nAlex: Incredible! That sounds like science fiction turning into scientific reality.",
      "clozeText": "Rapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In futuristic operating theater, scientists are developing motion-tracking infrared cameras to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice performing sterile surgeries with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering manipulating floating patient scans expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering contactless gesture sensor will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Gesture-Controlled Holographic Interfaces for Surgeons stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in futuristic operating theater. By combining motion-tracking infrared cameras with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in manipulating floating patient scans. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving performing sterile surgeries have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight contactless gesture sensor as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nRapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In futuristic operating theater, scientists are developing motion-tracking infrared cameras to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice performing sterile surgeries with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering manipulating floating patient scans expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering contactless gesture sensor will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nGesture-Controlled Holographic Interfaces for Surgeons stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in futuristic operating theater. By combining motion-tracking infrared cameras with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in manipulating floating patient scans. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving performing sterile surgeries have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight contactless gesture sensor as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Gesture-Controlled Holographic Interfaces for Surgeons represents an astonishing leap for science and humanity. Located in futuristic operating theater, it harnesses motion-tracking infrared cameras to solve challenges that once seemed insurmountable. Enabling people to practice performing sterile surgeries expands our cognitive and technological horizons. Furthermore, the relentless precision of contactless gesture sensor paves the way for interstellar exploration. I am confident this innovation will shape a brighter tomorrow.",
