      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What futuristic communication or scientific breakthrough are you presenting?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Liquid Methane Lakes and Cryogenic Exploration on Titan at outer planet mission center.\nAlex: What is the most astonishing feature of this innovation?\nMinh: Researchers and users are captivated by dense nitrogen-methane atmosphere and eager to test sailing robotic catamaran probes.\nAlex: How will it revolutionize human life or space exploration?\nMinh: It advances liquid ethane and methane seas and relies on the groundbreaking precision of radioisotope generator.\nAlex: Incredible! That sounds like science fiction turning into scientific reality.",
      "clozeText": "Rapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In outer planet mission center, scientists are developing dense nitrogen-methane atmosphere to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice sailing robotic catamaran probes with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering liquid ethane and methane seas expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering radioisotope generator will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Liquid Methane Lakes and Cryogenic Exploration on Titan stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in outer planet mission center. By combining dense nitrogen-methane atmosphere with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in liquid ethane and methane seas. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving sailing robotic catamaran probes have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight radioisotope generator as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nRapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In outer planet mission center, scientists are developing dense nitrogen-methane atmosphere to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice sailing robotic catamaran probes with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering liquid ethane and methane seas expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering radioisotope generator will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nLiquid Methane Lakes and Cryogenic Exploration on Titan stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in outer planet mission center. By combining dense nitrogen-methane atmosphere with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in liquid ethane and methane seas. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving sailing robotic catamaran probes have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight radioisotope generator as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
