      "audioScript": "Ben: Hi Trang! What futuristic communication or scientific breakthrough are you presenting?\nTrang: Hi Ben! I am presenting about Brain-Computer Interfaces Restoring Communication for Patients at neuro-engineering ward.\nBen: What is the most astonishing feature of this innovation?\nTrang: Researchers and users are captivated by implanted micro-electrode arrays and eager to test enabling paralyzed patients to speak.\nBen: How will it revolutionize human life or space exploration?\nTrang: It advances translating thoughts into speech and relies on the groundbreaking precision of wireless signal decoder.\nBen: Incredible! That sounds like science fiction turning into scientific reality.",
      "clozeText": "Rapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In neuro-engineering ward, scientists are developing implanted micro-electrode arrays to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice enabling paralyzed patients to speak with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering translating thoughts into speech expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering wireless signal decoder will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Brain-Computer Interfaces Restoring Communication for Patients stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in neuro-engineering ward. By combining implanted micro-electrode arrays with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in translating thoughts into speech. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving enabling paralyzed patients to speak have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight wireless signal decoder as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nRapid advancements in science, communication, and astrophysics are redefining human capabilities. In neuro-engineering ward, scientists are developing implanted micro-electrode arrays to unlock new frontiers in (23) ________. If these technologies mature, people will be able to practice enabling paralyzed patients to speak with unprecedented (24) ________. Many researchers reported that artificial intelligence (25) ________ transform daily healthcare and education. Furthermore, discovering translating thoughts into speech expands our understanding of life in the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, mastering wireless signal decoder will ensure that humanity thrives in a technologically advanced (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nBrain-Computer Interfaces Restoring Communication for Patients stands at the cutting edge of modern scientific inquiry and human imagination in neuro-engineering ward. By combining implanted micro-electrode arrays with advanced computing power, this innovation significantly accelerates breakthroughs in translating thoughts into speech. Early clinical or laboratory trials involving enabling paralyzed patients to speak have demonstrated extraordinary increases in operational speed and user safety. Astrophysicists and biomedical engineers highlight wireless signal decoder as the linchpin that makes these previously unimaginable feats possible. Moreover, whether enabling paralyzed patients to communicate or detecting habitable exoplanets, science enriches human dignity. As society navigates the ethical dimensions of advanced technologies, responsible innovation will guide human civilization toward cosmic wonders.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my view, Brain-Computer Interfaces Restoring Communication for Patients represents an astonishing leap for science and humanity. Located in neuro-engineering ward, it harnesses implanted micro-electrode arrays to solve challenges that once seemed insurmountable. Enabling people to practice enabling paralyzed patients to speak expands our cognitive and technological horizons. Furthermore, the relentless precision of wireless signal decoder paves the way for interstellar exploration. I am confident this innovation will shape a brighter tomorrow.",
