      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What topic on space exploration, digital devices, or career orientation are you analyzing?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about The International Space Station: Microgravity and Global Science at orbital space station.\nAlex: What is the most inspiring aspect of this subject?\nMinh: Experts and students are captivated by continuous zero-gravity research and eager to explore conducting crystal growth experiments.\nAlex: How does it prepare ninth graders for future academic and professional success?\nMinh: It provides deep perspectives on spacewalking outside solar arrays and underscores the significance of multinational astronaut team.\nAlex: Fantastic! That provides actionable guidance for our class as we prepare for high school.",
      "clozeText": "Preparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In orbital space station, researchers and career advisors utilize continuous zero-gravity research to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in conducting crystal growth experiments, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of spacewalking outside solar arrays reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating multinational astronaut team will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "The International Space Station: Microgravity and Global Science stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in orbital space station. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, continuous zero-gravity research and spacewalking outside solar arrays offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to conducting crystal growth experiments report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight multinational astronaut team as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPreparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In orbital space station, researchers and career advisors utilize continuous zero-gravity research to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in conducting crystal growth experiments, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of spacewalking outside solar arrays reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating multinational astronaut team will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe International Space Station: Microgravity and Global Science stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in orbital space station. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, continuous zero-gravity research and spacewalking outside solar arrays offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to conducting crystal growth experiments report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight multinational astronaut team as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, The International Space Station: Microgravity and Global Science offers crucial insights for the younger generation. In orbital space station, it harnesses continuous zero-gravity research to prepare students for the emerging frontiers of knowledge. Participating in conducting crystal growth experiments nurtures adaptability, analytical thinking, and technological confidence. Furthermore, mastering multinational astronaut team is essential for future career success in an increasingly automated world. I feel motivated to embrace these opportunities as I advance toward high school.",
