      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What topic on space exploration, digital devices, or career orientation are you analyzing?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Choosing Career Pathways in the Era of Artificial Intelligence at school career counseling hall.\nAlex: What is the most inspiring aspect of this subject?\nMinh: Experts and students are captivated by personalized vocational aptitude assessments and eager to explore interviewing industry professionals.\nAlex: How does it prepare ninth graders for future academic and professional success?\nMinh: It provides deep perspectives on rapidly emerging tech professions and underscores the significance of certified career guidance advisor.\nAlex: Fantastic! That provides actionable guidance for our class as we prepare for high school.",
      "clozeText": "Preparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In school career counseling hall, researchers and career advisors utilize personalized vocational aptitude assessments to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in interviewing industry professionals, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of rapidly emerging tech professions reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating certified career guidance advisor will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Choosing Career Pathways in the Era of Artificial Intelligence stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in school career counseling hall. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, personalized vocational aptitude assessments and rapidly emerging tech professions offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to interviewing industry professionals report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight certified career guidance advisor as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPreparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In school career counseling hall, researchers and career advisors utilize personalized vocational aptitude assessments to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in interviewing industry professionals, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of rapidly emerging tech professions reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating certified career guidance advisor will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nChoosing Career Pathways in the Era of Artificial Intelligence stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in school career counseling hall. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, personalized vocational aptitude assessments and rapidly emerging tech professions offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to interviewing industry professionals report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight certified career guidance advisor as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
