      "audioScript": "Ben: Hi Trang! What topic on space exploration, digital devices, or career orientation are you analyzing?\nTrang: Hi Ben! I am presenting about Satellite Remote Sensing for Climate and Flood Monitoring at satellite telemetry station.\nBen: What is the most inspiring aspect of this subject?\nTrang: Experts and students are captivated by high-resolution multispectral imagery and eager to explore analyzing agricultural soil moisture.\nBen: How does it prepare ninth graders for future academic and professional success?\nTrang: It provides deep perspectives on tracking seasonal typhoons and floods and underscores the significance of orbital Earth observation satellite.\nBen: Fantastic! That provides actionable guidance for our class as we prepare for high school.",
      "clozeText": "Preparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In satellite telemetry station, researchers and career advisors utilize high-resolution multispectral imagery to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in analyzing agricultural soil moisture, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of tracking seasonal typhoons and floods reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating orbital Earth observation satellite will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Satellite Remote Sensing for Climate and Flood Monitoring stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in satellite telemetry station. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, high-resolution multispectral imagery and tracking seasonal typhoons and floods offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to analyzing agricultural soil moisture report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight orbital Earth observation satellite as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPreparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In satellite telemetry station, researchers and career advisors utilize high-resolution multispectral imagery to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in analyzing agricultural soil moisture, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of tracking seasonal typhoons and floods reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating orbital Earth observation satellite will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSatellite Remote Sensing for Climate and Flood Monitoring stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in satellite telemetry station. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, high-resolution multispectral imagery and tracking seasonal typhoons and floods offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to analyzing agricultural soil moisture report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight orbital Earth observation satellite as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
