      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What topic on space exploration, digital devices, or career orientation are you analyzing?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Wearable Health Sensors and Real-Time Biometric Diagnostics at telehealth technology hub.\nAlex: What is the most inspiring aspect of this subject?\nMinh: Experts and students are captivated by continuous heart rate tracking wristbands and eager to explore monitoring elderly patient vital signs.\nAlex: How does it prepare ninth graders for future academic and professional success?\nMinh: It provides deep perspectives on blood oxygen saturation sensors and underscores the significance of cloud health records database.\nAlex: Fantastic! That provides actionable guidance for our class as we prepare for high school.",
      "clozeText": "Preparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In telehealth technology hub, researchers and career advisors utilize continuous heart rate tracking wristbands to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in monitoring elderly patient vital signs, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of blood oxygen saturation sensors reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating cloud health records database will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Wearable Health Sensors and Real-Time Biometric Diagnostics stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in telehealth technology hub. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, continuous heart rate tracking wristbands and blood oxygen saturation sensors offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to monitoring elderly patient vital signs report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight cloud health records database as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPreparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In telehealth technology hub, researchers and career advisors utilize continuous heart rate tracking wristbands to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in monitoring elderly patient vital signs, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of blood oxygen saturation sensors reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating cloud health records database will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nWearable Health Sensors and Real-Time Biometric Diagnostics stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in telehealth technology hub. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, continuous heart rate tracking wristbands and blood oxygen saturation sensors offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to monitoring elderly patient vital signs report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight cloud health records database as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
