      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What topic on space exploration, digital devices, or career orientation are you analyzing?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Deep Space Exploration: The James Webb Cosmic Discoveries at astronomical observatory.\nAlex: What is the most inspiring aspect of this subject?\nMinh: Experts and students are captivated by deep infrared cosmic views and eager to explore analyzing planetary atmospheres.\nAlex: How does it prepare ninth graders for future academic and professional success?\nMinh: It provides deep perspectives on capturing primordial galaxy lights and underscores the significance of deep space mirror array.\nAlex: Fantastic! That provides actionable guidance for our class as we prepare for high school.",
      "clozeText": "Preparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In astronomical observatory, researchers and career advisors utilize deep infrared cosmic views to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in analyzing planetary atmospheres, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of capturing primordial galaxy lights reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating deep space mirror array will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Deep Space Exploration: The James Webb Cosmic Discoveries stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in astronomical observatory. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, deep infrared cosmic views and capturing primordial galaxy lights offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to analyzing planetary atmospheres report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight deep space mirror array as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPreparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In astronomical observatory, researchers and career advisors utilize deep infrared cosmic views to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in analyzing planetary atmospheres, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of capturing primordial galaxy lights reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating deep space mirror array will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nDeep Space Exploration: The James Webb Cosmic Discoveries stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in astronomical observatory. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, deep infrared cosmic views and capturing primordial galaxy lights offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to analyzing planetary atmospheres report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight deep space mirror array as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, Deep Space Exploration: The James Webb Cosmic Discoveries offers crucial insights for the younger generation. In astronomical observatory, it harnesses deep infrared cosmic views to prepare students for the emerging frontiers of knowledge. Participating in analyzing planetary atmospheres nurtures adaptability, analytical thinking, and technological confidence. Furthermore, mastering deep space mirror array is essential for future career success in an increasingly automated world. I feel motivated to embrace these opportunities as I advance toward high school.",
