      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What topic on space exploration, digital devices, or career orientation are you analyzing?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Vocational Training versus Academic Higher Education Degrees at technical vocational college.\nAlex: What is the most inspiring aspect of this subject?\nMinh: Experts and students are captivated by hands-on mechatronics workshops and eager to explore operating computerized CNC machinery.\nAlex: How does it prepare ninth graders for future academic and professional success?\nMinh: It provides deep perspectives on guaranteed industry employment partnerships and underscores the significance of certified vocational instructor.\nAlex: Fantastic! That provides actionable guidance for our class as we prepare for high school.",
      "clozeText": "Preparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In technical vocational college, researchers and career advisors utilize hands-on mechatronics workshops to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in operating computerized CNC machinery, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of guaranteed industry employment partnerships reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating certified vocational instructor will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Vocational Training versus Academic Higher Education Degrees stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in technical vocational college. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, hands-on mechatronics workshops and guaranteed industry employment partnerships offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to operating computerized CNC machinery report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight certified vocational instructor as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPreparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In technical vocational college, researchers and career advisors utilize hands-on mechatronics workshops to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in operating computerized CNC machinery, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of guaranteed industry employment partnerships reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating certified vocational instructor will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nVocational Training versus Academic Higher Education Degrees stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in technical vocational college. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, hands-on mechatronics workshops and guaranteed industry employment partnerships offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to operating computerized CNC machinery report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight certified vocational instructor as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, Vocational Training versus Academic Higher Education Degrees offers crucial insights for the younger generation. In technical vocational college, it harnesses hands-on mechatronics workshops to prepare students for the emerging frontiers of knowledge. Participating in operating computerized CNC machinery nurtures adaptability, analytical thinking, and technological confidence. Furthermore, mastering certified vocational instructor is essential for future career success in an increasingly automated world. I feel motivated to embrace these opportunities as I advance toward high school.",
