      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What topic on space exploration, digital devices, or career orientation are you analyzing?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Artificial Intelligence in Medical Imaging and Radiology at radiology diagnostic suite.\nAlex: What is the most inspiring aspect of this subject?\nMinh: Experts and students are captivated by computer vision neural networks and eager to explore analyzing digital MRI scans.\nAlex: How does it prepare ninth graders for future academic and professional success?\nMinh: It provides deep perspectives on detecting microscopic lung tumors and underscores the significance of consulting medical radiologist.\nAlex: Fantastic! That provides actionable guidance for our class as we prepare for high school.",
      "clozeText": "Preparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In radiology diagnostic suite, researchers and career advisors utilize computer vision neural networks to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in analyzing digital MRI scans, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of detecting microscopic lung tumors reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating consulting medical radiologist will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Artificial Intelligence in Medical Imaging and Radiology stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in radiology diagnostic suite. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, computer vision neural networks and detecting microscopic lung tumors offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to analyzing digital MRI scans report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight consulting medical radiologist as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPreparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In radiology diagnostic suite, researchers and career advisors utilize computer vision neural networks to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in analyzing digital MRI scans, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of detecting microscopic lung tumors reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating consulting medical radiologist will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nArtificial Intelligence in Medical Imaging and Radiology stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in radiology diagnostic suite. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, computer vision neural networks and detecting microscopic lung tumors offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to analyzing digital MRI scans report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight consulting medical radiologist as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, Artificial Intelligence in Medical Imaging and Radiology offers crucial insights for the younger generation. In radiology diagnostic suite, it harnesses computer vision neural networks to prepare students for the emerging frontiers of knowledge. Participating in analyzing digital MRI scans nurtures adaptability, analytical thinking, and technological confidence. Furthermore, mastering consulting medical radiologist is essential for future career success in an increasingly automated world. I feel motivated to embrace these opportunities as I advance toward high school.",
