      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What topic on space exploration, digital devices, or career orientation are you analyzing?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Soft Skills for Future Jobs: Emotional Intelligence and Teamwork at youth leadership summit.\nAlex: What is the most inspiring aspect of this subject?\nMinh: Experts and students are captivated by active listening and empathy workshops and eager to explore resolving workplace workplace challenges.\nAlex: How does it prepare ninth graders for future academic and professional success?\nMinh: It provides deep perspectives on cross-cultural team collaboration and underscores the significance of experienced executive mentor.\nAlex: Fantastic! That provides actionable guidance for our class as we prepare for high school.",
      "clozeText": "Preparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In youth leadership summit, researchers and career advisors utilize active listening and empathy workshops to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in resolving workplace workplace challenges, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of cross-cultural team collaboration reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating experienced executive mentor will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Soft Skills for Future Jobs: Emotional Intelligence and Teamwork stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in youth leadership summit. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, active listening and empathy workshops and cross-cultural team collaboration offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to resolving workplace workplace challenges report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight experienced executive mentor as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPreparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In youth leadership summit, researchers and career advisors utilize active listening and empathy workshops to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in resolving workplace workplace challenges, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of cross-cultural team collaboration reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating experienced executive mentor will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSoft Skills for Future Jobs: Emotional Intelligence and Teamwork stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in youth leadership summit. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, active listening and empathy workshops and cross-cultural team collaboration offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to resolving workplace workplace challenges report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight experienced executive mentor as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, Soft Skills for Future Jobs: Emotional Intelligence and Teamwork offers crucial insights for the younger generation. In youth leadership summit, it harnesses active listening and empathy workshops to prepare students for the emerging frontiers of knowledge. Participating in resolving workplace workplace challenges nurtures adaptability, analytical thinking, and technological confidence. Furthermore, mastering experienced executive mentor is essential for future career success in an increasingly automated world. I feel motivated to embrace these opportunities as I advance toward high school.",
