      "audioScript": "Alex: Hi Minh! What topic on space exploration, digital devices, or career orientation are you analyzing?\nMinh: Hi Alex! I am presenting about Smart Homes and Internet of Things (IoT) Energy Management at IoT smart home pavilion.\nAlex: What is the most inspiring aspect of this subject?\nMinh: Experts and students are captivated by interconnected smart power meters and eager to explore optimizing domestic energy efficiency.\nAlex: How does it prepare ninth graders for future academic and professional success?\nMinh: It provides deep perspectives on automated lighting and heating schedules and underscores the significance of central IoT home hub.\nAlex: Fantastic! That provides actionable guidance for our class as we prepare for high school.",
      "clozeText": "Preparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In IoT smart home pavilion, researchers and career advisors utilize interconnected smart power meters to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in optimizing domestic energy efficiency, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of automated lighting and heating schedules reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating central IoT home hub will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Smart Homes and Internet of Things (IoT) Energy Management stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in IoT smart home pavilion. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, interconnected smart power meters and automated lighting and heating schedules offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to optimizing domestic energy efficiency report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight central IoT home hub as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPreparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In IoT smart home pavilion, researchers and career advisors utilize interconnected smart power meters to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in optimizing domestic energy efficiency, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of automated lighting and heating schedules reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating central IoT home hub will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSmart Homes and Internet of Things (IoT) Energy Management stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in IoT smart home pavilion. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, interconnected smart power meters and automated lighting and heating schedules offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to optimizing domestic energy efficiency report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight central IoT home hub as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
