      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_ck2.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Ben: Hi Trang! What topic on space exploration, digital devices, or career orientation are you analyzing?\nTrang: Hi Ben! I am presenting about Entrepreneurship and Startup Culture for Young High-Schoolers at youth innovation incubator.\nBen: What is the most inspiring aspect of this subject?\nTrang: Experts and students are captivated by pitching innovative technological solutions and eager to explore presenting to venture capital investors.\nBen: How does it prepare ninth graders for future academic and professional success?\nTrang: It provides deep perspectives on developing prototype business models and underscores the significance of startup founder mentor.\nBen: Fantastic! That provides actionable guidance for our class as we prepare for high school.",
      "clozeText": "Preparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In youth innovation incubator, researchers and career advisors utilize pitching innovative technological solutions to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in presenting to venture capital investors, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of developing prototype business models reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating startup founder mentor will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Entrepreneurship and Startup Culture for Young High-Schoolers stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in youth innovation incubator. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, pitching innovative technological solutions and developing prototype business models offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to presenting to venture capital investors report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight startup founder mentor as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPreparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In youth innovation incubator, researchers and career advisors utilize pitching innovative technological solutions to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in presenting to venture capital investors, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of developing prototype business models reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating startup founder mentor will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nEntrepreneurship and Startup Culture for Young High-Schoolers stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in youth innovation incubator. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, pitching innovative technological solutions and developing prototype business models offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to presenting to venture capital investors report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight startup founder mentor as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my perspective, Entrepreneurship and Startup Culture for Young High-Schoolers offers crucial insights for the younger generation. In youth innovation incubator, it harnesses pitching innovative technological solutions to prepare students for the emerging frontiers of knowledge. Participating in presenting to venture capital investors nurtures adaptability, analytical thinking, and technological confidence. Furthermore, mastering startup founder mentor is essential for future career success in an increasingly automated world. I feel motivated to embrace these opportunities as I advance toward high school.",
