      "audioScript": "Ben: Hi Trang! What topic on space exploration, digital devices, or career orientation are you analyzing?\nTrang: Hi Ben! I am presenting about Lifelong Learning and Upskilling in a Rapidly Evolving Market at digital continuing education center.\nBen: What is the most inspiring aspect of this subject?\nTrang: Experts and students are captivated by modular micro-credential courses and eager to explore adapting to automated labor markets.\nBen: How does it prepare ninth graders for future academic and professional success?\nTrang: It provides deep perspectives on continuous programming skill upgrades and underscores the significance of online educational platform.\nBen: Fantastic! That provides actionable guidance for our class as we prepare for high school.",
      "clozeText": "Preparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In digital continuing education center, researchers and career advisors utilize modular micro-credential courses to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in adapting to automated labor markets, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of continuous programming skill upgrades reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating online educational platform will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Lifelong Learning and Upskilling in a Rapidly Evolving Market stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in digital continuing education center. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, modular micro-credential courses and continuous programming skill upgrades offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to adapting to automated labor markets report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight online educational platform as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nPreparing for future careers, understanding digital devices, and exploring space are essential for ninth graders. In digital continuing education center, researchers and career advisors utilize modular micro-credential courses to prepare students for the global (23) ________. If students actively engage in adapting to automated labor markets, they will acquire adaptable vocational and digital (24) ________. Many educators emphasized that electronic gadgets (25) ________ utilized responsibly rather than for mindless distraction. Furthermore, advancing our understanding of continuous programming skill upgrades reminds us of our responsibility toward Earth and the wider (26) ________. In conclusion, cultivating online educational platform will empower youth to navigate modern challenges and build a fulfilling (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nLifelong Learning and Upskilling in a Rapidly Evolving Market stands at the intersection of technological transformation, future vocational readiness, and cosmic curiosity in digital continuing education center. As artificial intelligence and automated devices reshape employment landscapes, modular micro-credential courses and continuous programming skill upgrades offer invaluable career pathways. Students and professionals who commit to adapting to automated labor markets report enhanced digital literacy, cognitive flexibility, and professional confidence. Industry mentors and career counselors highlight online educational platform as an indispensable asset that bridges academic knowledge with commercial reality. Moreover, whether contemplating human settlements beyond Earth or mastering electronic communication, students broaden their ambitions. By combining technical proficiency, critical inquiry, and lifelong dedication, ninth graders will lead society toward extraordinary achievements.",
      "writingRubric": "Bố cục rõ ràng (0.25đ) - Ngữ pháp & Từ vựng chính xác (0.5đ) - Tính liên kết mạch lạc (0.25đ)",
