          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (80-100 words) about Lifelong Learning and Upskilling in a Rapidly Evolving Market.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Context in digital continuing education center; Key factors like modular micro-credential courses; Recommended activities like adapting to automated labor markets; Role of online educational platform in future careers.",
          "options": [],
          "correct": "In my perspective, Lifelong Learning and Upskilling in a Rapidly Evolving Market offers crucial insights for the younger generation. In digital continuing education center, it harnesses modular micro-credential courses to prepare students for the emerging frontiers of knowledge. Participating in adapting to automated labor markets nurtures adaptability, analytical thinking, and technological confidence. Furthermore, mastering online educational platform is essential for future career success in an increasingly automated world. I feel motivated to embrace these opportunities as I advance toward high school.",
          "correctLetter": "",
